# Authorization Domain - HTTP Examples
# This file is intended to run with JetBrains HTTP Client.
#
# Group/Scope endpoints (/api/groups, /api/scopes) were removed with the legacy RBAC model
# (native-authorization-model, RFC-001). Authorization is now capability-based -- see
# ARCHITECTURE.md for the full model. `adminToken` below must belong to a user with an active
# GymManagement.UserPlatformRoles row of PlatformRoleType.Admin to exercise the platform.* examples.

@host = http://localhost:5141
@adminToken = {{your_firebase_token}}
@userToken = {{your_firebase_token}}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Get or create authenticated user
POST {{host}}/api/users/get-or-create
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Get current user profile (self-access, no policy)
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Get user by id (requires capability:platform.users.read)
# Replace {id}
GET {{host}}/api/users/10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Logout (revoke Firebase refresh tokens)
POST {{host}}/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
